      },
      "beforeAfter": {
        "after": {
          "text": "データベース負荷の軽減や応答性の向上に向け、実践ガイド・参照アーキテクチャ・チュートリアルでキャッシュ手法を選べる",
          "origin": "mrc", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "source-only"
        }
      },
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": "how-it-works", "heading": "仕組み", "availability": "present", "priority": "core",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Redis が頻繁に使うデータをメモリに保持し、データベースへの読み取りを減らす",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/redis/overview", "locator": "What is Azure Managed Redis?", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-26T03:50:00Z" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "キャッシュ アサイド: Redis を先に確認し、無ければ DB から読んで TTL 付きで保存",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/architecture/databases/architecture/cache-aside-azure-managed-redis-postgresql", "locator": "冒頭", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-26T03:50:00Z" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "ライトスルー: SQL のコミット後に Redis を更新してから書き込み完了を返す",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/architecture/databases/architecture/write-through-caching-azure-sql-managed-redis", "locator": "冒頭", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-26T03:50:00Z" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "how-to-start", "heading": "始め方", "availability": "present", "priority": "core",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Azure SQL: App Service・Functions・SQL Database・Redis によるライトスルー構成の参照アーキテクチャ",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/architecture/databases/architecture/write-through-caching-azure-sql-managed-redis", "locator": "Architecture", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-26T03:50:00Z" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "PostgreSQL: App Service と Redis によるキャッシュ アサイドの参照アーキテクチャ",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/architecture/databases/architecture/cache-aside-azure-managed-redis-postgresql", "locator": "冒頭", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-26T03:50:00Z" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "Cosmos DB: 統合キャッシュと外部キャッシュ（Redis）の選び方を解説",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/cosmos-db/how-to-cache", "locator": "Choose between the integrated cache and an external cache", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-26T03:50:00Z" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "prerequisites-limits", "heading": "前提・制限", "availability": "present", "priority": "detail",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "DB が正本。Redis の値をコミット済みの業務データとして扱わない",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/architecture/databases/architecture/cache-aside-azure-managed-redis-postgresql", "locator": "Considerations", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-26T03:50:00Z" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "SQL と Redis にまたがるアトミックな分散トランザクションは提供されない（ライトスルー）",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/architecture/databases/architecture/write-through-caching-azure-sql-managed-redis", "locator": "シナリオの詳細", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-26T03:50:00Z" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "related-features", "heading": "似た手法との違い", "availability": "present", "priority": "detail",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "キャッシュ アサイドは一時的な古いデータを許容。書き込み直後に最新値が必要ならライトスルー",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/architecture/databases/architecture/cache-aside-azure-managed-redis-postgresql", "locator": "Important", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-26T03:50:00Z" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "Cosmos DB は統合キャッシュ（専用ゲートウェイ）か外部キャッシュの Redis を選べる",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/cosmos-db/how-to-cache", "locator": "Choose between the integrated cache and an external cache", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-26T03:50:00Z" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "use-case", "heading": "使いどころ・注意", "availability": "present", "priority": "detail",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "同じデータの読み取りが繰り返され、読み取りが多い API やアカウント プロファイルに向く",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/architecture/databases/architecture/write-through-caching-azure-sql-managed-redis", "locator": "考えられるユース ケース", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-26T03:50:00Z" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "読み取りがほぼ繰り返されない、または書き込みが多いワークロードではキャッシュを追加しない",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/cosmos-db/how-to-cache", "locator": "When to add a cache", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-26T03:50:00Z" }]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
